  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e698202a-25ba-4975-978d-967c2165ef62",
    "name": "Zitadel Management Applications API",
    "description": "The Zitadel Management API provides comprehensive identity infrastructure management including users, organizations, projects, applications, roles, policies, and identity providers. Accessible via REST at /management/v1/ with gRPC transcoding support. Zitadel is an open source identity platform supporting OAuth 2.0, OIDC, SAML, SCIM, FIDO2, and passkeys.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Zitadel",
